{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26685","headline":"寄主客刘郎中 · 姚合","name":"寄主客刘郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汉朝共许贾生贤，迁谪还应是宿缘。\n仰德多时方会面，拜兄何暇更论年。\n嵩山晴色来城里，洛水寒光出岸边。\n清景早朝吟丽思，题诗应费益州牋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26685.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26685","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}